# Inbox zero: capture three tasks with qi, move two of them to Work together, delete the third, then undo the delete.
file <<END
INBOX:
Work:
	- Write report
END
keys qi
type Email Bob tomorrow
keys <Enter> qi
type Order toner
keys <Enter> qi
type Lunch idea
keys <Enter>
keys gi
see › INBOX
keys J gm
see Move to
type work
keys <Enter>
see › Work
keys gi dd
hide Lunch idea
keys z
see - Lunch idea
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Lunch idea
Work:
	- Write report
	- Email Bob @start({today+1})
	- Order toner
END
